parent = {
 'temporary_key': PARENT,
 'name': B('进程发现','Process Discovery'),
 'summary': B('调查当前运行的进程及其可得身份和状态，理解主机运行角色并为后继行动选择目标，同时可能借用管理工具或驻留上下文降低查询的独立可辨识度。','Survey running processes and available identity and state to understand host roles and select follow-on targets, potentially borrowing administrative tools or resident contexts to reduce the inquiry’s separate visibility.'),
 'aliases': [],
 'definition_and_concept': P(
  B('进程发现是攻击者取得主机或管理接口访问后，查询当前运行实例的存在性、名称、PID、父关系、映像位置、所属主体或其他可得运行状态的环境测绘行为。直接目标是理解此时实际活动的软件与进程关系，选择进一步调查、访问或操作的对象；某个程序已经安装并不说明它正在运行，读取进程名也不证明已经取得该进程的内存、令牌或秘密。','Process Discovery is environmental mapping in which an adversary with host or management-interface access queries the existence, name, PID, parent relationship, image location, ownership, or other available state of running instances. Its immediate goal is to understand active software and process relationships and select objects for further investigation, access, or action. Installation does not establish execution, and a process name does not establish acquisition of memory, tokens, or secrets.'),
  B('同一行为可通过命令、脚本、WMI、系统API、procfs或设备管理命令实现，分类依据始终是运行进程事实。证据应区分提出查询、获得快照或枚举器、遍历返回条目与消费具体属性；即使查询在同一进程中执行，也必须证明它确实针对进程信息，而不能只从模块已执行或API已解析推断发现已经完成。','Commands, scripts, WMI, system APIs, procfs, and device-management commands can implement the behavior, but running-process facts remain the classification anchor. Evidence must separate a request, a snapshot or enumerator, returned entries, and consumed properties. Even an inquiry performed inside one process must demonstrably concern process information; module execution or API resolution alone does not establish completed discovery.')
 ),
 'stealth_characteristics': P(
  B('进程发现大量借用诊断、资产管理和故障处理所需的只读接口。tasklist和Get-Process的正常外观可以使恶意调查与值班排障相似；合法签名、系统路径和一次成功启动不能说明操作者的调查目的。残留的查询参数、父进程、登录上下文、远程来源及异常目标选择，仍可把这种相似外观放回实际工作语境。','Process Discovery often borrows read interfaces needed for diagnostics, inventory, and troubleshooting. The ordinary appearance of tasklist and Get-Process can make adversarial surveying resemble support work. A legitimate signature, system path, or successful launch does not explain the operator’s purpose. Query arguments, parent processes, logon context, remote origin, and unusual targeting remain available to place that appearance in a work context.'),
  B('攻击者还可以把一次进程查询交给已驻留的受控执行体，省去为该任务另起工具或牺牲进程的明确边界，使只数进程创建的观察面缺少本次调查的独立入口。这种变化不等于进程或查询不可见：WMI的客户端请求、provider活动、枚举结果、宿主资源和代码来源仍可能留下证据。其收益取决于防守方是否把这些观察与正确的进程实例关联，而不是取决于系统是否默认记录某个接口。','An adversary can also assign an inquiry to an already resident controlled execution context, removing the separate utility or sacrificial-process boundary that a process-creation-only observer would associate with the task. This does not make the process or inquiry invisible. WMI client requests, provider activity, enumeration results, host resource use, and code origin can still leave evidence. The benefit depends on whether defenders join those observations to the right process instance, rather than on whether an interface is logged by default.')
 ),
 'scope_boundary_definition': P(
  B('纳入直接询问或读取运行进程存在性与属性的行为，包括本机或获授权远程视图中的进程清单、特定进程定位以及对返回实例的详情查询。解释结果时保留目标主机、会话或命名空间、查询时间、字段权限与结果完整性；快照反映采集时刻而不是永久状态，PID和同名映像都不能独立充当跨生命周期身份。','Include direct inquiries or reads about process existence and properties, including local or authorized remote inventories, locating a particular process, and detail queries on returned instances. Preserve host, session or namespace, query time, field permissions, and result completeness. A snapshot represents its acquisition time rather than permanent state, and neither a PID nor a repeated image name independently identifies an instance across lifetimes.'),
  B('仅查安装软件、窗口标题或焦点、驱动包及加载驱动分别归相邻发现技术；进程清单可能提供它们的线索，但不能取代相应事实。打开句柄或具备QUERY、VM_READ、TERMINATE权限不证明读取详情、提取凭据、注入或终止已经发生。根据进程名判断分析环境并停用载荷、破坏安全进程或执行凭据转储，需要分别证明环境条件化规避、安全削弱、影响或凭据访问动作。','Installed-software queries, window titles or focus, driver packages, and loaded drivers belong to neighboring discovery techniques. A process list can provide leads without establishing those facts. Opening a handle or holding QUERY, VM_READ, or TERMINATE rights does not establish detailed reads, credential extraction, injection, or termination. Process-based analysis-environment decisions, security-process impairment, and credential dumping each require evidence of the respective conditioned-evasion, defense-impairment, impact, or credential-access action.'),
  B('驻留查询的子项只描述本次进程调查的任务承载选择，不承接建立驻留体、反射加载、跨进程嵌入或非标准API过渡本身的结论。合法监控、EDR、桌面管理、任务管理器和应用健康检查可以进行同形查询；过滤返回行、减少显示列或选用熟悉工具也不能单独证明匿迹设计。','The resident-query child concerns how the particular process-survey task is carried, not establishment of the resident agent, reflective loading, cross-process embedding, or nonstandard API transitions themselves. Legitimate monitoring, EDR, desktop management, task managers, and application health checks make similar inquiries. Filtering returned rows, displaying fewer columns, or selecting a familiar tool does not independently establish an evasion design.')
 ),
 'application_scenarios_and_threat_model': {
  'application_scenarios': P(
   B('在初始立足后，操作者可调查服务器运行角色和交互式应用，寻找值得深入分析的服务、用户活动或后继目标。Microsoft记录Volt Typhoon调查运行进程，WithSecure在No Pineapple调查中记录tasklist与Get-Process Lsass；这些记录支持恶意进程调查，不公开证明每次输出值、最终目标选择或查询导致的逃逸。','After gaining a foothold, operators can survey server roles and interactive applications to identify services, user activity, or follow-on targets worth investigating. Microsoft reports running-process discovery by Volt Typhoon, while WithSecure records tasklist and Get-Process Lsass in No Pineapple. These observations establish adversarial process surveying without public proof of each returned value, final target selection, or query-induced evasion.'),
   B('自动化植入体可在一次操作前取得进程事实，也可在运行期间刷新视图以判断组件是否存在。持续监视与一次快照在时间意义上不同，但高频维护不自然等于匿迹；当前证据只支持把有明确承载对照的驻留内联调查正式化，不能把所有轮询、通知或条件触发都转成子项。','Automated agents may obtain process facts before an action or refresh their view to check component presence during operation. Continuous monitoring and a single snapshot have different temporal meanings, but frequent maintenance is not inherently evasive. Present evidence supports formalizing resident inline surveying with an explicit carrier comparison, not turning all polling, notifications, or conditional triggers into children.')
  ),
  'threat_model': {
   'attacker_model': P(
    B('攻击者需要能够执行查询代码、命令或管理请求，并观察可用返回。普通用户通常可得到部分进程存在性，详细路径、模块、所属主体或其他用户进程的信息受接口、完整性、权限和平台配置约束；查询失败、缺字段与空结果不能被假定为系统不存在该进程。远程调查另需可达接口及相应身份。','The adversary needs the ability to execute inquiry code, commands, or management requests and inspect available returns. An ordinary user may obtain some existence information, while detailed paths, modules, ownership, or other users’ processes depend on interface, integrity, permissions, and configuration. Failure, missing fields, and empty results do not establish process absence. Remote surveying additionally requires a reachable interface and suitable identity.'),
    B('实施驻留内联调查还需要控制既有进程中的任务调度或扩展执行能力，并承担查询阻塞、崩溃和权限继承的限制。它不赋予新的读取授权，也不要求已攻陷WMI provider；攻击者只可消费该上下文与目标接口实际允许的视图。','Resident inline surveying additionally requires task dispatch or extension execution within an existing process and carries blocking, crash, and inherited-permission constraints. It grants no new read authority and does not require compromise of the WMI provider. The adversary can consume only the view allowed to that context by the target interface.')
   ),
   'defender_model': P(
    B('防守方可持有含命令行的进程创建记录、Windows PowerShell 5.1脚本块内容和经配置的WMI Trace。前两者揭示工具或脚本语义，WMI Trace可揭示原始客户端、命名空间和查询文本；它们不自动提供结果行。Sysmon进程访问事件只描述打开其他进程，不覆盖全部进程枚举接口，不能当作进程清单输出。','Defenders may hold process-creation records with command lines, Windows PowerShell 5.1 script-block content, and configured WMI Trace. The first two expose utility or script semantics, while WMI Trace can expose the original client, namespace, and query text. They do not automatically provide result rows. Sysmon process-access events describe opening another process rather than every enumeration interface and cannot stand in for process-list output.'),
    B('观察必须保留客户端所在主机、事件时间与进程生命周期；PID重用、provider复用、远端客户端及缺失创建记录会削弱归属。若没有验证过的结果采集，防守方只能说明提出了什么调查，不能说明攻击者已取得全部进程。Linux、macOS、ESXi和网络设备的接口仍在父范围内，本次可实施检测主要落实于Windows，不能宣称同等遥测覆盖。','Observation must retain client host, event time, and process lifetime. PID reuse, provider reuse, remote clients, and missing creation records weaken attribution. Without validated result capture, defenders can state what was requested rather than that the adversary acquired every process. Linux, macOS, ESXi, and network-device interfaces remain in parent scope, but implementable analytics in this delivery primarily cover Windows and do not establish equivalent telemetry elsewhere.')
   )
  }
 },
 'stealth_mechanisms': [
  dict(mechanism_ref='NM-FD',role='primary',summary=B('借用正常进程盘点工具和管理查询外观，使恶意调查与诊断工作相似','Borrow ordinary process-inventory tools and management-query appearance to resemble diagnostics'),
   analysis=P(B('攻击者选择与合法排障重叠的系统工具和只读查询路径，使局部可见特征仍是常见管理程序与进程信息请求。Microsoft对就地取材活动的调查以及WithSecure记录的进程命令支持这种行为外观；从外观到辨识困难的因果判断保持中等置信度，因为缺少针对进程查询的告警对照。其作用是增加目的判断所需语境，不消除参数、身份或结果工件。','Selecting system utilities and read-query paths shared with legitimate troubleshooting leaves local features resembling familiar management programs and process-information requests. Microsoft’s living-off-the-land investigation and WithSecure’s process commands support this appearance. The causal conclusion about distinguishing intent remains medium-confidence because process-query alert comparisons are unavailable. The effect is to require more context about purpose, without removing arguments, identity, or result artifacts.')),
   evidence_keys=['REF-000073','REF-001230','B016-T1057-REF-TASKLIST'],confidence='medium'),
  dict(mechanism_ref='NM-BT',role='secondary',summary=B('将进程调查留在既有驻留执行上下文，避开按每任务新进程识别查询的观察假设','Keep the inquiry in an existing resident context to bypass per-task process-creation identification'),
   analysis=P(B('官方BOF设计明确把每任务fork&run的创建与注入足迹作为对照，TrustedSec的固定集成入口又把具体进程查询送入beacon_inline_execute；因而这里的变化是调查任务不再拥有单独工具进程的创建边界。仅依靠新tasklist或PowerShell启动识别调查的逻辑会缺少这一输入，需改从客户端查询与宿主实例恢复行为。WMI服务、provider、代码及实际对象返回仍是可见面，这一能力链不证明现场漏检或所有驻留API均匿迹。','The official BOF design explicitly contrasts per-task fork-and-run creation and injection footprints, and TrustedSec’s pinned integration sends a concrete process inquiry through beacon_inline_execute. The changed trace is the absence of a separate utility-process creation boundary for that task. Logic identifying inquiries solely through new tasklist or PowerShell launches loses that input and must recover activity from client queries and the host instance. WMI services, providers, code, and returned objects remain observation surfaces. This capability chain establishes neither field-level missed detection nor stealth for every resident API call.')),
   evidence_keys=['B016-T1057-REF-BOF','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-SOURCE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','REF-000366'],confidence='medium')
 ],
 'subtechnique_taxonomy': {
  'narrative': P(
   B('当前建立驻留上下文内联进程调查一项子技术，以本次查询是否借已有受控执行体完成、相对于另起每任务执行器的生命周期差分为变量。它必须包含实际进程查询语义和驻留承载的正面证据，不能从缺少进程创建日志、进程已运行很久或某个API名称自动成立；系统provider可能另有进程，不能据此否认客户端内联执行。','The current taxonomy establishes Resident-Context Inline Process Survey using the lifecycle difference between carrying a particular inquiry in an existing controlled context and creating a per-task executor. It requires positive evidence of process-query semantics and resident carriage, not inference from missing creation logs, a long-running process, or an API name. A system provider may use another process without negating client-side inline execution.'),
   B('按工具、操作系统、PID/路径/命令行字段、快照API或输出格式划分都没有独立匿迹边界。另行检查的通知式等待、低频刷新与选择性过滤尚缺本次行为的意图和观察对照；进程隐匿、运行态嵌入、安全削弱和沙箱判断则由相邻技术负责。能力证据允许本项保持中等置信度，实际恶意事件只支持父行为。','Tool names, operating systems, PID/path/command-line fields, snapshot APIs, and output formats do not define independent evasion boundaries. Notification-based waiting, low-frequency refresh, and selective filtering lack intent and observation comparisons for this behavior in the reviewed evidence. Process hiding, runtime embedding, defense impairment, and sandbox decisions belong to neighboring techniques. Capability evidence supports medium confidence for this child, while the malicious incidents support only the parent behavior.')
  ), 'coverage':'established', 'subtechnique_keys':[CHILD]
 },
 'defense': {'detections':{'coverage':'available','strategy_keys':['B016-T1057-DET-UTILITY','B016-T1057-DET-RESIDENT']},'mitigations':{'coverage':'available','mitigation_keys':['B016-T1057-MIT-VISIBILITY']}},
 'evidence': {'claim_keys':['B016-T1057-CLM-RELEVANCE','B016-T1057-CLM-FD','B016-T1057-CLM-SNAPSHOT','B016-T1057-CLM-IDENTITY','B016-T1057-CLM-RESIDENT','B016-T1057-CLM-BT','B016-T1057-CLM-WMI-RESULT','B016-T1057-CLM-AUDIT','B016-T1057-CLM-MITIGATION'],
              'case_keys':['B016-T1057-CASE-VOLT','B016-T1057-CASE-NOPINEAPPLE'],
              'reference_keys':[r['temporary_key'] for r in refs]+['REF-000073','REF-001230','REF-000334','REF-000623','REF-000366','REF-000598','REF-000463','REF-000805','REF-000200']},
 'research': {'limitations':P(
  B('现场报告证明有进程调查而不提供每次完整输出或查询方案对照。内联子项由官方设计文档与可核验源码支持，未在所列恶意事件中定位到该实现，故不把Volt Typhoon或No Pineapple归为该子项，也不报告其降低告警概率。TrustedSec文章的独立COFFLoader演示与真正内联集成需要区分。','Incident reports establish process surveying without complete per-request output or comparative query implementations. The inline child is supported by official design documentation and verifiable source, but that implementation was not identified in the listed malicious incidents. Volt Typhoon and No Pineapple therefore are not mapped to the child, and no alert-probability reduction is reported. TrustedSec’s standalone COFFLoader demonstration must remain distinct from actual inline integration.'),
  B('进程视图随时间、用户、权限、命名空间及传感器而变，空返回和缺字段可能来自访问拒绝、过滤或竞态。一次枚举不会证明所有对象已取得，也不会使同名进程或重用PID自动成为同一实例。本批没有执行恶意样本或生产环境覆盖测试；查询Trace、结果采集和缓解效应仍需目标环境验证。','Process views vary by time, user, permission, namespace, and sensor. Empty returns or missing fields can result from denial, filtering, or races. One enumeration does not establish acquisition of every object or make repeated names and reused PIDs the same instance. This delivery did not run malicious samples or test production coverage. Query tracing, result capture, and mitigation effects require validation in the target environment.')
 )}
}

child = {
 'temporary_key':CHILD, 'parent_key':PARENT,
 'name':B('驻留上下文内联进程调查','Resident-Context Inline Process Survey'),
 'summary':B('把具体进程查询及结果处理交给既有受控执行体，减少每任务新建工具或牺牲进程提供的独立调查入口。','Carry a concrete process inquiry and its result handling in an existing controlled context, reducing the separate inquiry entry provided by a newly created per-task utility or sacrificial process.'),
 'aliases':[], 'lineage':{'attck_subtechnique_inherited':False},
 'definition_and_concept':P(
  B('驻留上下文内联进程调查是攻击者有意把本次运行进程查询放入已驻留且可调度任务的执行上下文，而不为它创建独立查询工具或每任务牺牲进程的实现。直接目的仍是取得进程事实；匿迹变量是查询任务与执行器生命周期的关系，而不是WMI、BOF、系统API或某个产品的名称。','Resident-Context Inline Process Survey deliberately places a particular running-process inquiry inside an already resident task-capable execution context rather than creating a separate query utility or per-task sacrificial process. Its immediate purpose remains obtaining process facts. The evasion variable is the relationship between query-task and executor lifetimes, rather than WMI, BOFs, system APIs, or a product name.'),
  B('能力证据提供明确对照：官方BOF文档讨论内联执行相对于fork&run的任务足迹，固定源码把进程查询接入既有Beacon并返回进程字段。独立运行相同COFF对象的加载器、仅载入一个模块或长期存在的程序，没有同时证明本次内联查询时均不足以纳入。','Capability evidence supplies an explicit comparison: official BOF documentation contrasts inline execution with fork-and-run task footprints, and pinned source connects a process inquiry to an existing Beacon and returns process fields. A standalone loader running the same COFF object, a module load, or a long-lived program is insufficient without positive evidence of this particular inline inquiry.')
 ),
 'stealth_characteristics':P(
  B('驻留上下文内联进程调查减少的是本次调查作为新工具进程出现的边界，使依赖tasklist、wmic或PowerShell新启动的检测不能仅靠创建事件定位它。宿主本身仍存在且可以有异常代码、任务请求或网络关系；降低独立工具特征不使宿主获得正常身份，也不证明其全部行为已经融合进业务。','Resident-Context Inline Process Survey reduces the boundary where an inquiry appears as a new utility process, so detectors depending on fresh tasklist, wmic, or PowerShell launches cannot locate it from creation events alone. The host still exists and may expose anomalous code, task requests, or network relationships. Reduced utility features do not make its identity legitimate or establish that all its activity blends into business work.'),
  B('该变化保留管理查询的正面痕迹。以已核验WMI实现为例，客户端的ExecQuery、目标命名空间、枚举器消费和返回对象可以被观察；provider可能在既有或新建服务进程中工作。应恢复原始查询客户端和任务，而不是把WmiPrvSE的父进程或没有新工具事件当作攻击者归属。','The change retains positive management-query traces. In the verified WMI implementation, client ExecQuery, target namespace, enumerator consumption, and returned objects can be observed; the provider may operate in an existing or newly created service process. Attribution must recover the original client and task rather than treating WmiPrvSE’s parent or absent utility events as the adversary’s identity.')
 ),
 'scope_boundary_definition':P(
  B('纳入需要已驻留执行上下文、可归属的本次进程查询以及相对每任务执行器的明确承载选择。查询提出与结果消费分级记录，返回对象仅证明实际可见部分；远端WMI查询保留客户端和目标两端身份，不把目标provider进程当成原始发起者。','Inclusion requires an existing resident execution context, an attributable process inquiry, and an explicit carrier choice relative to a per-task executor. Record requests and result consumption at separate evidence levels, with returned objects establishing only the observed portion. Remote WMI inquiries retain client and target identities without treating the target provider process as the originator.'),
  B('反射加载代码执行由NJT-0077负责，跨进程写入与实际调度由NJT-0103负责，非标准原生过渡或动态解析由NJT-0073负责；这些前序动作可共映射，但不能替代进程查询事实。合法插件、监控与安全代理也会内联查询；缺日志、无需新进程的API或单纯不启动tasklist都不是充分条件。','NJT-0077 owns reflective module execution, NJT-0103 owns cross-process writing and actual dispatch, and NJT-0073 owns nonstandard native transitions or dynamic resolution. Those predecessor actions may co-map but cannot replace process-query evidence. Legitimate plugins, monitoring, and security agents also make inline inquiries. Missing logs, APIs needing no new process, or merely avoiding tasklist are insufficient conditions.')
 ),
 'application_scenarios_and_threat_model':{
  'application_scenarios':P(B('当攻击者已有支持短任务的驻留代理、需要在下一步操作前掌握进程视图，并希望减少单独后渗透工具的启动链时，可选择内联调查。当前具体能力由TrustedSec任务入口及其WMI实现支持；它适用于一次有限查询，不应把阻塞式BOF扩写成长期异步监视。','An adversary with a resident agent supporting short tasks can choose inline surveying when process awareness is needed before an action and a separate post-exploitation utility launch is undesirable. The specific capability is supported by TrustedSec’s task entry and WMI implementation. It supports a bounded inquiry, not an inferred long-running asynchronous monitor.')),
  'threat_model':{
   'attacker_model':P(B('攻击者须已掌握能够在既有进程中接收和执行查询任务的上下文，能够构造有效请求并接收对象或输出。现有token与目标接口决定可读范围；远程选项另需相应登录token与网络访问。单线程阻塞或任务崩溃可能影响驻留代理，因此内联承载带来稳定性代价，不能无条件替代所有外部任务。','The adversary must already control a context able to receive and execute inquiries within an existing process, construct valid requests, and receive objects or output. Existing tokens and target interfaces determine readable scope. Remote options additionally require an appropriate logon token and network access. Single-thread blocking or crashes can affect the resident agent, making inline carriage a stability tradeoff rather than a universal replacement for external tasks.')),
   'defender_model':P(
    B('目标观察模型是能够看到进程创建、却主要按每次新启动工具识别发现任务的端点。已配置WMI Trace及进程生命周期保留时，可以把Win32_Process请求与真实客户端实例对应；独立结果采集才能说明哪些对象被消费。过程内存、扩展来源与宿主职责也提供残留语境，但一次查询不能自动证明注入或恶意代码来源。','The target observation model sees process creation but identifies discovery chiefly through a newly launched utility for each task. Configured WMI Trace and retained process lifetimes can associate Win32_Process requests with the actual client instance. Independent result capture is required to establish consumed objects. Memory, extension origin, and host duties provide residual context, but one query does not automatically establish injection or malicious code provenance.'),
    B('如果仅留provider本地PID、只收错误事件、Trace开始晚于任务、客户端生命周期已丢失或跨机身份无法连接，归属会退化为未知。API或结果内容观测增强后，此项相对创建事件检测的优势可明显收缩；本批没有性能或误报率测量。','Attribution degrades to unknown if only a provider-local PID is retained, only errors are collected, tracing starts after the task, the client lifetime is lost, or cross-host identities cannot be joined. Better API or result-content observation can substantially reduce its advantage over creation-event detection. This delivery contains no performance or false-positive-rate measurement.')
   )
  }
 },
 'stealth_mechanisms':[
  dict(mechanism_ref='NM-BT',role='primary',summary=B('省去每次查询单独启动执行器的边界，迫使检测转向驻留客户端的实际进程请求','Remove the per-query executor launch boundary and require observation of the resident client’s actual process request'),
   analysis=P(B('选择既有执行上下文会把一次查询与新工具进程的对应关系拆开。官方设计的对照和具体内联查询入口共同支持这一可控变化；只盯每任务创建与注入序列的检测缺少预期入口，而WMI请求与宿主生命周期关联仍能恢复它。这里没有断言系统不生成任何服务进程、对象访问或结果痕迹，匿迹强度只相对于所述观察假设保持中等置信度。','Choosing an existing context separates a particular inquiry from a new utility-process identity. The official design comparison and concrete inline-query entry jointly support this controlled change. Detection focused on per-task creation and injection sequences loses its expected entry, while WMI requests joined to host lifetimes can recover the activity. No claim is made that the system generates no service processes, object accesses, or result traces. Stealth strength remains medium-confidence relative to that observation assumption.')),
   evidence_keys=['B016-T1057-REF-BOF','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-SOURCE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','REF-000366'],confidence='medium')
 ],
 'defense':{'detections':{'coverage':'available','strategy_keys':['B016-T1057-DET-RESIDENT']},'mitigations':{'coverage':'available','mitigation_keys':['B016-T1057-MIT-VISIBILITY']}},
 'evidence':{'claim_keys':['B016-T1057-CLM-RESIDENT','B016-T1057-CLM-BT','B016-T1057-CLM-WMI-RESULT','B016-T1057-CLM-IDENTITY'], 'case_keys':[],
  'reference_keys':['B016-T1057-REF-BOF','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-ARTICLE','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-SOURCE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-QUERY','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-NEXT','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-PROCESS','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-ACCESS','B016-T1057-REF-PROCESSIDENTITY','REF-000366','REF-000598']},
 'research':{'limitations':P(
  B('本项的成立性是可复核的能力与设计意图结论，尚无本次所选现场案例直接确认其恶意采用，也没有对创建事件检测与客户端查询检测的定量比较。工具作者将演示放入独立COFFLoader，只有已核验的Aggressor入口支持驻留集成；不能把演示截图当成内联恶意活动。','Existence is a reproducible capability and design-intent conclusion. The selected incidents do not directly confirm malicious adoption, and no quantitative comparison between creation-event and client-query detection is available. The author’s demonstrations use standalone COFFLoader; resident integration is supported by the verified Aggressor entry. Demonstration screenshots are not inline malicious activity.'),
  B('当前专用分析验证对象是WMI实现，不能自动覆盖所有进程内API、直接系统调用或其他操作系统。内联工作与合法代理任务相似，仍需原始客户端、职责、批准任务及实际结果语义；确认完整进程集尤其受快照时点、权限与生命周期竞态限制。','The dedicated analytic addresses the WMI implementation rather than every in-process API, direct syscall, or operating system. Inline work resembles legitimate agent tasks and still requires original-client identity, duties, approved work, and actual result semantics. Establishing a complete process set is particularly limited by snapshot time, permissions, and lifecycle races.')
 )}
}

det_utility = dict(temporary_key='B016-T1057-DET-UTILITY',name=B('显式进程调查的请求语义与任务来源核验','Explicit Process-Inquiry Semantics and Work-Origin Verification'),
 summary=B('解析进程盘点命令及脚本，核对主体职责和目标范围，并把执行尝试与实际结果分开。','Parse process-inventory commands and scripts, check principal duties and target scope, and distinguish attempts from actual results.'),
 description=P(B('本策略覆盖以可见工具或脚本发起的Windows进程查询。分析保留本地与远端目标、名称/PID过滤及查询所需的属性，再以进程实例、会话与批准工作解释它；不会把tasklist名称、LSASS目标或工具合法签名单独作为恶意定论。驻留WMI查询由另一策略恢复原始客户端。','This strategy covers Windows process inquiries issued through visible utilities or scripts. Its analytic retains local or remote targets, name/PID filters, and requested properties, then interprets them using process instances, sessions, and approved work. The tasklist name, an LSASS target, or a legitimate utility signature alone is not a malicious verdict. A separate strategy restores the original client of resident WMI inquiries.')),
 detects_keys=[PARENT],domains=['enterprise'],analytic_keys=['B016-T1057-NJA-UTILITY'],
 evidence_keys=['B016-T1057-REF-TASKLIST','B016-T1057-REF-GETPROCESS','REF-001230','REF-000598','REF-000334','REF-000623','REF-000463'])

nja_utility = dict(temporary_key='B016-T1057-NJA-UTILITY',strategy_key=det_utility['temporary_key'],
 name=B('Windows 进程查询命令与登录任务关联','Windows Process-Inquiry Commands and Logon-Task Correlation'),
 summary=B('输出具有原始参数、进程实例与结果等级的异常进程调查线索。','Produce anomalous process-survey leads with original arguments, process instances, and evidence levels.'),domains=['enterprise'],platforms=['Windows'],
 logic=P(
  B('从DeviceProcessEvents的已验证ProcessCreated动作中解析tasklist的完整参数，保留/s、/u、/fi和输出格式；帮助请求不算已执行盘点。对powershell.exe仅在命令行或已重组的Windows PowerShell 5.1脚本块能恢复Get-Process、其内置别名gps/ps的实际解析以及Name/Id等目标时生成process_query_attempt；自定义同名函数和不可见交互脚本保留未知。模块或版本请求保留详情访问类别，不把Stop-Process、WMI Create/Terminate或单纯软件清单误当成进程查询。','Parse full tasklist arguments from validated ProcessCreated actions in DeviceProcessEvents, preserving /s, /u, /fi, and output format. Help requests do not establish an executed inventory. For powershell.exe, generate process_query_attempt only when command lines or reconstructed Windows PowerShell 5.1 script blocks recover Get-Process, actual resolution of built-in gps/ps aliases, and Name/Id targets. Keep custom same-name functions and invisible interactive scripts unknown. Retain module or version inquiries as detail requests, and exclude Stop-Process, WMI Create/Terminate, and software-only inventories.'),
  B('将DeviceId、Timestamp、ProcessId、ProcessCreationTime、AccountSid、LogonId、ProcessCommandLine、InitiatingProcessId及InitiatingProcessCreationTime分别映射host_id、timestamp、process_id、process_start、principal_id、logon_id、command_line、parent_process_id与parent_process_start，ActionType映射event_action、FolderPath与FileName构成image_path。event_id由原始DeviceName+Timestamp+ReportId构成，不能拿ReportId当进程身份。4104补充分支按ScriptBlockId、MessageNumber与MessageTotal重组ScriptBlockText，进程字段来自事件System Execution并以同机生命周期关联；它记录处理过的脚本，不记录完整输出。','Map DeviceId, Timestamp, ProcessId, ProcessCreationTime, AccountSid, LogonId, ProcessCommandLine, InitiatingProcessId, and InitiatingProcessCreationTime to host_id, timestamp, process_id, process_start, principal_id, logon_id, command_line, parent_process_id, and parent_process_start. Map ActionType to event_action and FolderPath plus FileName to image_path. Construct event_id from original DeviceName, Timestamp, and ReportId rather than treating ReportId as process identity. The supplemental 4104 branch reassembles ScriptBlockText by ScriptBlockId, MessageNumber, and MessageTotal and joins System Execution process metadata to the same-host lifetime. It records processed script content rather than complete output.'),
  B('在十分钟内按主体、主机、登录与进程实例连接批准支持或监控作业，比较目标主机、属性和时间范围。未知管理来源、超出职责的高价值进程定位及已知入侵会话提高优先级；输出仅为请求线索。重定向临时路径只作为工件位置，即使文件创建或进程退出成功也不升级结果；只有另外解析到与同一查询和时点匹配的可信输出时才报告process_rows_observed，并保留字段缺失和部分返回。','Within ten minutes, join approved support or monitoring work by principal, host, logon, and process instance, comparing target host, properties, and time scope. Unknown management origins, high-value process targeting outside duties, and known intrusion sessions raise priority; the output remains a request lead. A redirected temporary path only locates an artifact. File creation or a successful exit does not upgrade the evidence. Report process_rows_observed only when independent trusted output is parsed and matched to the same inquiry and time, preserving missing fields and partial returns.')
 ),
 data_requirements=[dict(source_type='endpoint-process-event',name=B('MDE进程创建及谱系','MDE process creation and lineage'),channel='DeviceProcessEvents',required_fields=['host_id','timestamp','event_action','event_id','process_id','process_start','image_path','command_line','principal_id','logon_id','parent_process_id','parent_process_start']),
                    dict(source_type='powershell-script-block',name=B('可选Windows PowerShell 5.1脚本语义分支','Optional Windows PowerShell 5.1 script-semantics branch'),channel='Microsoft-Windows-PowerShell/Operational',required_fields=['host_id','timestamp','process_id','script_block_id','message_number','message_total','script_block_text']),
                    dict(source_type='approved-work-record',name=B('批准监控与支持任务','Approved monitoring and support work'),channel=None,required_fields=['principal_id','host_id','target_scope','valid_from','valid_until','owner'])],
 observables=[B('含真实过滤和远端目标的tasklist请求。','Tasklist requests with actual filters and remote targets.'),B('可见Get-Process脚本语义与详情访问参数。','Visible Get-Process semantics and detail-query arguments.'),B('调查主体、进程祖先和批准任务范围之间的差异。','Differences among querying principal, ancestry, and approved work scope.')],
 correlation={'window':B('十分钟关联一次查询与登录任务，进程身份须从创建起保留到终止；十分钟是初始工程值而非恶意阈值。','Join an inquiry with logon work over ten minutes, retaining process identity from creation to termination. Ten minutes is an initial engineering value rather than a maliciousness threshold.'),'dimensions':['host_id','principal_id','logon_id','process_id','process_start','target_host','query_semantics']},
 false_positives=[B('任务管理、EDR和软件监控的定期盘点。','Task management, EDR, and software-monitoring inventories.'),B('故障处理、凭据保护检查与远程支持。','Troubleshooting, credential-protection checks, and remote support.')],
 blind_spots=[B('API、GUI和驻留查询不一定新建工具进程；没有本规则命中不排除进程发现。','APIs, GUIs, and resident inquiries need not launch utilities; no match does not exclude discovery.'),B('MDE未部署、创建动作或参数缺失、4104未开启或内容丢段，均降低请求可恢复性；本分支不覆盖PowerShell 7事件通道。','Absent MDE, missing creation actions or arguments, disabled or incomplete 4104, and fragment loss reduce recoverability. This branch does not cover PowerShell 7 channels.'),B('PID重用、同名函数与过滤显示可使字段含义错误；命令及脚本不证明实际返回。','PID reuse, same-name functions, and output filtering can mislead interpretation; commands and scripts do not establish returned facts.')],
 tuning_guidance=P(B('先验证一个普通清单、特定PID查询、拒绝详情、远端失败和帮助请求，确认normalizer保留原始参数与状态。缺脚本源时仍运行命令分支但标注脚本盲区；批准任务必须绑定身份、目标、职责与有效期，不能永久放行签名工具或所有管理账户。4688可作为替代采集实现，但须开启Audit Process Creation及命令行、解释版本和创建者/目标主体，并重建创建时间，不能假装字段与MDE完全等同。','Validate a normal inventory, a specific-PID inquiry, denied details, a failed remote request, and help output to confirm retention of original arguments and state. Without the script source, run the command branch while marking its script gap. Approved work must bind identity, target, duty, and expiry; do not permanently allow signed tools or all administrators. Event 4688 can implement an alternative collector, but requires process-creation and command-line auditing, version and creator/target-subject interpretation, and reconstructed creation time rather than assumed MDE field equivalence.')),
 evidence_keys=det_utility['evidence_keys'])

det_resident = dict(temporary_key='B016-T1057-DET-RESIDENT',name=B('驻留进程调查的原始客户端与查询生命周期恢复','Original-Client and Query-Lifetime Recovery for Resident Process Surveys'),
 summary=B('从实际WMI进程查询恢复客户端实例及结果等级，补足按新工具启动识别调查的盲点。','Recover client instances and evidence levels from actual WMI process inquiries to supplement utility-launch-based detection.'),
 description=P(
  B('本策略直接覆盖驻留上下文内联进程调查的WMI实现，并同样能够识别非内联的WMI查询。它以查询内容、客户端与任务承载关系为起点，保留provider和原始客户端的不同身份；策略不需要出现新工具启动，也不把缺少启动记录作为内联证明。','This strategy directly covers the WMI implementation of Resident-Context Inline Process Survey and can also identify non-inline WMI inquiries. It starts from query content, client identity, and task carriage, retaining distinct provider and original-client identities. It requires no new utility launch and does not use missing launch records to prove inline execution.'),
  B('基础分析使用已验证Trace与进程生命周期输出可归属查询线索，独立结果采集只在部署并校验后提高证据等级。Win32_Process的查询、Create/Terminate方法及普通provider活动分流，避免把运行查询与执行或安全削弱混同。','The base analytic uses validated Trace and process lifetimes to produce attributable inquiry leads. Independent result capture raises the evidence level only after deployment and validation. Route Win32_Process queries, Create/Terminate methods, and ordinary provider activity separately to avoid merging inquiry with execution or defense impairment.')
 ),detects_keys=[PARENT,CHILD],domains=['enterprise'],analytic_keys=['B016-T1057-NJA-RESIDENT'],
 evidence_keys=['B016-T1057-REF-BOF','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-SOURCE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-QUERY','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-NEXT','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-PROCESS','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-ACCESS','B016-T1057-REF-PROCESSIDENTITY','REF-000598','REF-000366'])

nja_resident = dict(temporary_key='B016-T1057-NJA-RESIDENT',strategy_key=det_resident['temporary_key'],
 name=B('WMI进程请求、客户端实例与返回对象分级关联','Graded Correlation of WMI Process Requests, Client Instances, and Returned Objects'),
 summary=B('把Win32_Process请求归还给准确客户端生命周期，并区分查询入口、枚举器和实际对象。','Attribute Win32_Process requests to the exact client lifetime and distinguish query entry, enumerators, and actual objects.'),domains=['enterprise'],platforms=['Windows'],
 logic=P(
  B('在目标版本预先启用并验证Microsoft-Windows-WMI-Activity/Trace。解析包含IWbemServices::ExecQuery或CreateInstanceEnum且对象为Win32_Process的事件，保留WQL、命名空间、本地或远端客户端与操作标识；查询投影只限Name、ProcessId等属性也仍属于进程信息请求。把ExecMethod的Create/Terminate、Win32_Product与仅元数据查询分流。Trace Event 11示例的Operation保存查询语义，ClientProcessId是客户端，不是事件System Execution中的服务PID；Event 12的HostID只标识provider承载。','Enable and validate Microsoft-Windows-WMI-Activity/Trace on the target version in advance. Parse events containing IWbemServices::ExecQuery or CreateInstanceEnum on Win32_Process, retaining WQL, namespace, local or remote client, and operation identifiers. Projections limited to Name or ProcessId remain process inquiries. Route ExecMethod Create/Terminate, Win32_Product, and metadata-only inquiries separately. In the documented Trace Event 11 example, Operation carries query semantics and ClientProcessId identifies the client rather than the service PID in System Execution. Event 12 HostID identifies provider carriage only.'),
  B('将Computer、TimeCreated、ClientMachine、User、ClientProcessId、Operation、CorrelationId、GroupOperationId及OperationId规范为host_id、timestamp、client_host、principal_id、client_process_id、query_text、correlation_id、group_operation_id与operation_id；namespace从经校验的请求字段或Operation解析为namespace。按client_host及查询时刻，把client_process_id连接该机MDE的ProcessId+ProcessCreationTime，或经验证Sysmon ProcessGuid的存活区间。只连接在时刻上仍存活的唯一实例，跨机无法证明或进程创建已丢失时标attribution_unknown；不把provider的本地PID嫁接为客户端。','Normalize Computer, TimeCreated, ClientMachine, User, ClientProcessId, Operation, CorrelationId, GroupOperationId, and OperationId to host_id, timestamp, client_host, principal_id, client_process_id, query_text, correlation_id, group_operation_id, and operation_id. Parse namespace from validated request fields or Operation. Join client_process_id at query time on client_host to that host’s MDE ProcessId plus ProcessCreationTime or a validated Sysmon ProcessGuid lifetime. Join only a unique instance alive at the time. Mark attribution_unknown when cross-host identity is unproven or birth records are missing; never attach a provider-local PID as the client.'),
  B('基础输出是process_query_observed，并与批准代理、资产盘点和诊断任务比较；宿主职责外的进程调查以及异常任务来源提高优先级。只有另有正面内联任务调度、可验证代码或查询调用链证据，才标记resident_carriage_supported；没有新工具进程不增加该等级。若可选受控采集直接记录ExecQuery的flags/HRESULT及关联枚举器，成功只升级enumerator_returned，PROTOTYPE不升级。Next的apObjects与puReturned经实际解析后才记录process_rows_observed，保留部分对象、错误与空集；WBEM_S_FALSE可伴随有效对象，TIMEDOUT不证明完整空返回。','The base output is process_query_observed and is compared with approved agents, inventories, and diagnostics. Process surveying outside host duties and anomalous task origin raise priority. Mark resident_carriage_supported only with positive inline-task dispatch, verified code, or query call-chain evidence; no new utility process does not raise that level. If optional controlled capture records ExecQuery flags/HRESULT and its enumerator, success raises only enumerator_returned and PROTOTYPE does not upgrade it. Record process_rows_observed only after actually parsing Next apObjects and puReturned, preserving partial objects, errors, and empty sets. WBEM_S_FALSE can accompany valid objects and TIMEDOUT does not establish a complete empty return.'),
  B('返回ProcessId、ParentProcessId和CreationDate时将它们保留为目标实例属性，不与客户端PID混用；同名进程及旧快照需按目标主机、创建时间和返回时刻解释。十分钟只用于一次任务关联，宿主生命周期和历史保留须覆盖较早创建的驻留体；查询慢于窗口时继续以operation标识追踪而不拆成新查询。','Retain returned ProcessId, ParentProcessId, and CreationDate as target-instance attributes rather than client PIDs. Interpret repeated names and older snapshots by target host, creation time, and return time. Ten minutes scopes a task join, while host-lifetime history must cover resident processes created earlier. Continue slow inquiries using operation identifiers rather than splitting them at the window boundary.')
 ),
 data_requirements=[dict(source_type='wmi-query-trace',name=B('预先开启且通过样例验证的WMI Trace','Pre-enabled WMI Trace validated against sample operations'),channel='Microsoft-Windows-WMI-Activity/Trace',required_fields=['host_id','timestamp','client_host','principal_id','client_process_id','namespace','query_text','correlation_id','group_operation_id','operation_id']),
                    dict(source_type='endpoint-process-lifecycle',name=B('客户端主机经验证的进程生命周期','Validated process lifetimes on the client host'),channel='Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational Events 1 and 5',required_fields=['host_id','timestamp','process_id','process_start','process_instance_id','image_path','principal_id','parent_process_id','lifetime_end']),
                    dict(source_type='approved-work-record',name=B('批准代理与调查任务','Approved agents and inquiry tasks'),channel=None,required_fields=['owner','client_host','principal_id','target_scope','valid_from','valid_until']),
                    dict(source_type='instrumented-wmi-result',name=B('可选受控WMI调用及对象采集合同','Optional controlled WMI-call and object-capture contract'),channel=None,required_fields=['client_host','timestamp','process_instance_id','request_id','namespace','query_text','query_flags','hresult','enumerator_id','returned_count','returned_objects','capture_stage'])],
 observables=[B('真实客户端针对Win32_Process的ExecQuery文本或实例枚举请求。','Actual-client ExecQuery text or instance enumeration directed at Win32_Process.'),B('原始客户端与provider承载进程的不同身份。','Separate identities for original clients and provider-host processes.'),B('可选的枚举器创建、Next返回数与具体进程属性。','Optional enumerator creation, Next counts, and concrete process properties.'),B('可核验的内联任务入口与查询在同一驻留实例中的执行关系。','Verifiable inline-task entry and inquiry execution in the same resident instance.')],
 correlation={'window':B('一次请求初始采用十分钟，并保留operation标识直至结束；客户端进程历史覆盖从创建到查询与终止，不能只查十分钟前的新进程。','Initially use ten minutes per request and retain operation identifiers until completion. Client history spans creation, inquiry, and termination rather than only processes born in the last ten minutes.'),'dimensions':['client_host','client_process_id','process_start','process_instance_id','principal_id','namespace','correlation_id','group_operation_id','operation_id','request_id','target_host']},
 false_positives=[B('EDR、任务管理器、资产管理与运维代理在既有进程中执行WMI盘点。','EDR, task managers, inventory managers, and operations agents making WMI inquiries in existing processes.'),B('插件或管理控制台的临时进程调查与远程故障排查。','Ad hoc process inquiries by plugins or consoles and remote troubleshooting.')],
 blind_spots=[B('Trace默认覆盖、事件版本和丢失不能假定；Operational错误日志、命名空间4662或Sysmon进程访问事件不等价于完整查询与输出。','Default Trace coverage, versions, and loss cannot be assumed. Operational error logs, namespace event 4662, and Sysmon process-access events are not complete query/output telemetry.'),B('非WMI内联API和直接系统调用需要另行验证的传感器；本分析不冒充全部进程发现覆盖。','Non-WMI inline APIs and direct syscalls require separately validated sensors; this analytic does not claim coverage of all process discovery.'),B('仅存请求或成功枚举器时无法确认具体对象；PID重用、跨机时钟和被丢弃的创建事件会破坏精确归属。','Requests or successful enumerators alone cannot establish concrete objects. PID reuse, cross-host clocks, and missing birth events can break exact attribution.')],
 tuning_guidance=P(
  B('上线前分别验证普通查询、零结果、拒绝、PROTOTYPE、部分Next返回、WBEM_S_FALSE带对象、超时和远端客户端，记录目标版本实际字段。基础Trace+生命周期分支可独立运行，可选结果源仅在其原生调用参数与缓冲区被验证采集后启用；request_id、enumerator_id与capture_stage是传感器规范化字段，不宣称Windows标准日志自动提供。Sysmon Event 1的Computer、UtcTime、ProcessId、ProcessGuid、Image、User和ParentProcessId映射客户端生命周期，process_start来自创建记录、lifetime_end来自相同ProcessGuid的Event 5；存活或已丢失终止记录时结束时间保留unknown。MDE创建记录可以补强身份，但不能假设其表必然给出终止事件。','Before deployment, validate normal queries, zero results, denial, PROTOTYPE, partial Next returns, WBEM_S_FALSE with objects, timeouts, and remote clients, documenting actual fields for the target version. The Trace-plus-lifetime branch can run independently. Enable optional result capture only after validating native parameters and buffers. request_id, enumerator_id, and capture_stage are sensor normalization fields rather than automatic Windows-log fields. Map Sysmon Event 1 Computer, UtcTime, ProcessId, ProcessGuid, Image, User, and ParentProcessId to the client lifetime, deriving process_start from birth and lifetime_end from Event 5 with the same ProcessGuid. Keep the end unknown for a living process or lost termination. MDE births can enrich identity without assuming its table necessarily provides terminations.'),
  B('按代理职责、客户端来源、命名空间和批准目标建立基线；不得放行所有WmiPrvSE请求或只按宿主签名放行。采集调用栈或代码来源只能增强已有查询事实的解释，不替代查询本身。控制对象内容和命令行的访问与保留，记录Trace事件量、缓冲区丢失以及不可解释的进程身份。','Baseline agent duties, client origin, namespace, and approved targets. Do not allow every WmiPrvSE request or allow solely by host signature. Call stacks and code origin can enrich an established inquiry but cannot replace it. Control access and retention for object content and command lines, and record Trace volume, buffer loss, and unresolved process identities.')
 ),evidence_keys=det_resident['evidence_keys'])

mit = dict(temporary_key='B016-T1057-MIT-VISIBILITY',name=B('进程视图最小暴露与查询来源问责','Least Process-View Exposure and Query-Origin Accountability'),
 summary=B('收缩不必要的进程详情与管理读取权限，并把实际查询绑定准确主体、任务和进程生命周期。','Reduce unnecessary process-detail and management-read authority and bind actual inquiries to exact principals, tasks, and process lifetimes.'),
 description=P(
  B('进程清单是系统诊断和安全产品依赖的基础事实，无法普遍向已获准代码隐藏。控制目标是在不破坏运行可观测性的前提下减少无关主体看到的详情，并使系统工具和驻留代理的查询均可追溯；限制读取、约束执行与改善观察分别发挥作用，不能相互冒充。','Process inventory is a basic fact needed by diagnostics and security products and cannot be universally hidden from authorized code. Controls reduce details exposed to unrelated principals while making inquiries from utilities and resident agents traceable. Read restriction, execution constraints, and improved observation perform distinct roles and cannot substitute for one another.'),
  B('Windows重点核对进程查询权限、调试特权和WMI命名空间授权；Linux可在验证兼容性后使用procfs的hidepid和受控例外组。对驻留查询，查询层证据与长期进程身份的保留是直接控制面，而非仅阻断tasklist名称。','On Windows, review process-query rights, debug privilege, and WMI namespace authorization. On Linux, validated procfs hidepid settings and controlled exception groups can reduce exposure. For resident inquiries, query-layer evidence and long-lived process identities are direct control surfaces rather than only blocking the tasklist name.')
 ),domains=['enterprise'],
 measures=[
  dict(key='limit-process-detail',name=B('限制不必要的进程视图与详情权限','Limit unnecessary process views and detailed authority'),control_type='exposure-reduction',description=P(B('审计并撤销非必要SeDebugPrivilege和跨主体进程详情访问，按任务管理WMI命名空间读取与Remote Enable；Linux按角色评估hidepid=1或2及gid例外，不以默认全局进程可见性代替业务需求分析。先验证诊断、监控和安全代理兼容性。','Audit and remove unnecessary SeDebugPrivilege and cross-principal process-detail access. Manage WMI namespace read and Remote Enable rights by task. On Linux, assess hidepid=1 or 2 and gid exceptions by role rather than assuming global process visibility is required. Validate diagnostics, monitoring, and security-agent compatibility first.'))),
  dict(key='approved-inquiry-carriers',name=B('约束批准的调查执行体','Constrain approved inquiry carriers'),control_type='exposure-reduction',description=P(B('登记盘点和支持任务的owner、主体、主机、可用脚本与查询范围；在适用Windows环境以系统应用控制约束未批准代码和脚本能力，核对驻留代理的扩展及管理入口。受信宿主或允许的脚本仍需按实际查询审查。','Register inventory and support owners, principals, hosts, scripts, and query scopes. Where applicable, use system application control to constrain unapproved code and script capabilities, and review resident-agent extensions and management entry points. Trusted hosts and allowed scripts still require review of actual inquiries.'))),
  dict(key='query-origin-lifetime-retention',name=B('保留查询来源与进程生命周期','Retain query origins and process lifetimes'),control_type='detective-support',description=P(B('预先部署含参数的进程审计与适用脚本日志，在重点Windows主机验证WMI Trace客户端字段和长生命周期关联。分别验证请求、拒绝、空集和部分结果，将证据送入查询者不能任意修改的保留范围；需要结果时另行部署经验证采集，不用授权事件充当结果。','Predeploy process auditing with arguments and applicable script logs. On priority Windows hosts, validate WMI Trace client fields and long-lived process joins. Test requests, denial, empty sets, and partial results separately and retain evidence beyond the querier’s arbitrary modification. Deploy validated capture when results are needed rather than using authorization events as results.')))
 ],
 applications=[
  dict(target_key=PARENT,use=P(B('对进程发现，按主机职责保留必要监控，缩小不相关用户的进程详情和远程WMI读取范围，并登记支持查询的目标与期限。查询事件同批准作业比较时保留请求级别，未取得结果不推断全量进程暴露。','For Process Discovery, preserve monitoring required by host duties while narrowing unrelated users’ process-detail and remote-WMI read scope. Register support targets and expiry. Compare inquiries with approved work at the request level, without inferring complete process exposure when results are unavailable.')),
       expected_effect=P(B('不必要的跨用户进程细节和远程调查机会减少，借用系统工具的查询更容易与具体任务核验；Linux进程目录的可见范围可按配置实际收缩。','Unnecessary cross-user process details and remote-survey opportunities decrease, and borrowed utility inquiries become easier to check against concrete work. Linux process-directory visibility can be reduced according to effective configuration.')),
       limitations=P(B('普通用户和合法程序仍可能得到基础进程存在性，Windows详情权限不普遍阻断进程列表；hidepid也不能阻止同用户、特权主体或其他存在性侧信号。应用控制并不禁止所有Get-Process，审计还增加敏感参数与运维成本。','Ordinary users and legitimate programs may still obtain basic process existence. Windows detail rights do not universally block lists, and hidepid does not stop same-user or privileged access or every existence side signal. Application control does not prohibit every Get-Process call, and auditing carries sensitive-argument and operational costs.'))),
  dict(target_key=CHILD,use=P(B('对驻留上下文内联进程调查，不把“没有新工具启动”作为放行依据。将允许的驻留代理和扩展绑定实际职责，在Win32_Process读取面保留客户端主机、PID实例和操作标识，追溯本次查询来自哪项任务，并为长期运行体保留早期创建历史。','For Resident-Context Inline Process Survey, do not use “no new utility launch” as an allow condition. Bind approved resident agents and extensions to actual duties. At the Win32_Process read surface, retain client host, PID instance, and operation identifiers to recover the task behind each inquiry, including earlier birth history for long-running agents.')),
       expected_effect=P(B('防守观察从每任务执行器扩展到真实查询客户端，减少生命周期承载变化造成的归属断点。可验证结果采集能进一步确定暴露的字段和实例，使攻击者不能只靠省去工具进程让调查失去语义。','Observation extends from per-task executors to actual query clients, reducing attribution gaps caused by carrier-lifetime choices. Validated result capture can establish exposed fields and instances, preventing omission of a utility process alone from stripping the inquiry of meaning.')),
       limitations=P(B('这项应用主要改善识别与归属，不能保证阻止已控制的受信进程读取其获准视图，也不能让App Control自动检查任意BOF缓冲区。非WMIAPI、Trace缺失、跨机客户端不可归属或缺少结果采集仍是盲区；需要容量与隐私评估。','This application chiefly improves identification and attribution. It cannot guarantee blocking an already controlled trusted process from its authorized view or make App Control inspect arbitrary BOF buffers automatically. Non-WMI APIs, missing Trace, unresolved remote clients, and absent result capture remain gaps, requiring capacity and privacy assessment.')))
 ],evidence_keys=['B016-T1057-REF-PROCESSRIGHTS','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-ACCESS','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','B016-T1057-REF-BOF','REF-000805','REF-000200','REF-000623','REF-000463','REF-000598'])

def C(key, claim_type, zh, en, subjects, evidence, mode='strongly-inferred', confidence='medium'):
    return dict(temporary_key=key,claim_type=claim_type,statement_zh=zh,statement_en=en,subject_keys=subjects,evidence_keys=evidence,evidence_mode=mode,confidence=confidence,status='review')

claims=[
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-RELEVANCE','technique-relevance','Microsoft记录Volt Typhoon发现运行进程，WithSecure记录No Pineapple的tasklist及Get-Process Lsass命令，支持恶意运行进程调查的父行为。','Microsoft records running-process discovery by Volt Typhoon, and WithSecure records tasklist and Get-Process Lsass in No Pineapple, supporting the parent behavior of adversarial running-process surveying.',[PARENT],['REF-000073','REF-001230'],'directly-observed','high'),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-FD','mechanism-mapping','恶意活动借用与诊断相同的进程盘点工具时，可见工具特征与正常工作重叠，目的判断需要身份和任务语境；没有进程查询专属漏检测量。','When adversarial activity borrows the same process-inventory tools as diagnostics, visible utility features overlap legitimate work and purpose requires identity and task context; no process-query-specific missed-detection measurement is available.',[PARENT],['REF-000073','REF-001230','B016-T1057-REF-TASKLIST']),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-SNAPSHOT','technique-boundary','TH32CS_SNAPPROCESS忽略作为筛选器的PID参数并包含全部进程；成功创建快照句柄不等于Process32First已把条目复制给调用者。','TH32CS_SNAPPROCESS includes all processes rather than using the PID argument as a filter; successfully creating a snapshot handle does not establish that Process32First copied an entry to the caller.',[PARENT],['B016-T1057-REF-SNAPSHOT','B016-T1057-REF-PROCESSFIRST'],'directly-observed','high'),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-IDENTITY','technique-boundary','进程PID只在其生命周期内有效，旧快照、重用PID和仍开放的句柄不能独立证明同一存活实例。','A process PID is valid within its lifetime; old snapshots, reused PIDs, and still-open handles do not independently establish the same live instance.',[PARENT,CHILD],['B016-T1057-REF-PROCESSIDENTITY','REF-000805','REF-000366'],'strongly-inferred','high'),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-RESIDENT','subtechnique-existence','官方BOF文档给出相对每任务fork&run的驻留执行足迹对照，TrustedSec固定入口与源码进一步实现内联Win32_Process查询，支持以查询任务承载生命周期为变量的子项，置信度限于能力而非恶意采用。','Official BOF documentation compares resident execution footprints with per-task fork-and-run, and TrustedSec’s pinned entry and source implement inline Win32_Process queries, supporting a child based on inquiry-carrier lifetime at capability rather than malicious-adoption confidence.',[CHILD],['B016-T1057-REF-BOF','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-ARTICLE','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-SOURCE']),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-BT','mechanism-mapping','经正面证据确认的驻留查询可省去独立查询工具的创建边界，削弱只按每任务新进程识别发现的观察假设；它不消除WMI客户端、provider或结果痕迹。','A positively established resident inquiry can remove a separate query-utility creation boundary and weaken per-task-new-process identification; it does not remove WMI-client, provider, or result traces.',[PARENT,CHILD],['B016-T1057-REF-BOF','B016-T1057-REF-TRUSTEDSEC-SOURCE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','REF-000366']),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-WMI-RESULT','detection','ExecQuery成功可只返回枚举器，实际进程对象需由Next返回值、数量和对象共同确认；WBEM_S_FALSE不排除有效对象。','Successful ExecQuery can return only an enumerator. Actual process objects require Next status, counts, and objects together; WBEM_S_FALSE does not exclude valid objects.',[PARENT,CHILD],['B016-T1057-REF-WMI-QUERY','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-NEXT'],'directly-observed','high'),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-AUDIT','detection','WMI Trace中的客户端查询语义与同机进程生命周期可恢复查询归属，进程创建、ProcessAccess和命名空间授权事件都不能单独提供进程枚举输出。','Client-query semantics in WMI Trace joined to same-host process lifetimes can recover query attribution; creation, ProcessAccess, and namespace-authorization events cannot individually provide process-enumeration output.',[PARENT,CHILD],['B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-ACCESS','REF-000366','REF-000598'],'strongly-inferred','high'),
 C('B016-T1057-CLM-MITIGATION','mitigation','进程详情权限、WMI命名空间授权和Linux hidepid约束不同可见面，不能普遍隐藏运行进程；保留客户端查询及生命周期主要改善驻留调查的问责。','Process-detail rights, WMI namespace authorization, and Linux hidepid constrain different views without universally hiding running processes; retaining client queries and lifetimes chiefly improves accountability for resident inquiries.',[PARENT,CHILD],['B016-T1057-REF-PROCESSRIGHTS','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-ACCESS','B016-T1057-REF-WMI-TRACE','REF-000805'])
]

